          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મીઠાઈ — mīṭhāī — \"sweets, sweetmeat\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "દિવાળીમાં અમે મીઠાઈ ખાઈએ છીએ. — divāḷīmā̃ ame mīṭhāī khāīe chīe — \"We eat sweets at Diwali.\""
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built on મીઠું, mīṭhũ, sweet."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મીઠાઈ (mīṭhāī) is built on the inherited mīṭhũ, \"sweet\", with the noun ending -āī; EtymDB derives it from that word. CDIAL traces mīṭhũ to Sanskrit miṣṭa, \"dainty, sweet\" (CDIAL 10299)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
